## Ruby Integration

```ruby
require 'mathpix'

client = Mathpix::Client.new(
  app_id: ENV['MATHPIX_APP_ID'],
  app_key: ENV['MATHPIX_APP_KEY']
)

result = client.process_image('equation.png')
puts result.latex  # "E = mc^2"
```

